<title>UK: IADB plans $500 mln five-year Eurobond -Lehman/JPM.</title>
<headline>IADB plans $500 mln five-year Eurobond -Lehman/JPM.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Inter-American Development Bank (IADB) will launch a $500 million five-year Eurobond, joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and J.P. Morgan said on Monday.</p>
<p>Launch was expected on Tuesday, they said.</p>
<p>There was no official spread talk.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
